# Codebase map (do not re-explore blindly)

Before launching explore/subagents to map this repo’s dashboards, Homey, weather, or device patterns, **read `docs/codebase-map.md` first**.

Only explore further when that doc is missing the area you need, then **update `docs/codebase-map.md`** with what you learned.

## Quick pointers

| Need | Start here |
| ---- | ---------- |
| Routes / pages | `src/index.js` → `src/pages/{Stue,Entre,Andre}/` |
| 2nd-floor rooms config | `src/pages/Andre/rooms.js` |
| Homey client | `src/helpers/getHomey.js`, `useGetDevices`, `useGetDevice`, `useMakeCapabilityInstance` |
| Flows | `src/components/Flows/helpers/triggerFlow.js` |
| Weather | `src/server/routes/weather.js`, `useFetchForecast`, `getForecastItemsForDay` |
| Insights / temp API | `src/server/routes/temperature.js`, `src/server/insights.js` |
| Sonos | `src/components/Devices/Sonos/` (`SonosFocus` supports `deviceId`, `embedded`) |
| AudioPro | `src/components/Devices/AudioProSpeaker/` |
| Roborock | `src/components/Devices/Roborock/`, `/andre` vacuum via `clean_full` |
| Verify | `scripts/verify.js` — `/`, `/entre`, `/andre`, temp loft, weather |
